Screenshot5.png", "id": "920379771814818", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031399_920379775148151_6130082779285979181_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3_q-pH_gen0Q7kNvwH7bXLR&_nc_oc=AdoFZrK2aBvels41_1Bh2Qy8trv_cDlSWsvwSiy76SzYAkVqOdB3EmU0xqbRRCMBsZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_3SxN8WQXHZvolclCsle2PqyneBWK7hRS4IzJOWwuFQA&oe=6A467A92"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "LoopWorlds", "keywords": ["logic", "puzzle", "brain", "create", "portal"], "long_description": "LoopWorlds is a game of difficult logic puzzles, with disco dance-floor graphics. \n\nAfter each stage of 8 levels, a new game mechanic will be added, including sliding ice blocks, button-activated walls, and portals.\n\nSwipe the touch pad to move the disco ball in that direction, and it will keep moving until it hits something. Also if the disco ball leaves a screen edge, it will loop back in again on the opposite side, making for a very interesting brain challenge. It gets pretty epic!\n\nYou can also create your own awesome levels and let your family try them out later.", "short_description": "LoopWorlds is a game of difficult logic puzzles, with disco dance-floor graphics. After each stage of 8 levels, a new game mechanic will be added, including sliding ice blocks, button-activated walls, and portals. It gets pretty epic!"}]}, "developer_name": "Robert Hendry Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ultimateboostage.com/?page_id=150", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Robert Hendry Games", "support_website_url": "https://www.ultimateboostage.com/", "website_url": "https://www.ultimateboostage.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "PUZZLE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "i